Fonts
* apps/api/internal/pdffont/fonts: Liberation Sans (SIL Open Font License 1.1; LiberationSans-LICENSE.txt) and
  Noto fonts, some subset or compressed (SIL Open Font License 1.1; Noto-OFL.txt). Details in that folder's README.
* The web apps download these Google Fonts at build time through next/font and serve them with the static exports:
  Inter, Geist Mono, Caveat and Dancing Script (SIL Open Font License 1.1), and Homemade Apple (Apache License 2.0).

Schemas, specifications and test data from public authorities (unchanged; their publishers' terms apply)
* apps/api/internal/ksef/testdata: KSeF FA(3) XML schemas (Ministerstwo Finansów, crd.gov.pl) and the KSeF API 2.0
  OpenAPI document (Ministerstwo Finansów, MIT License; openapi/LICENSE.txt).
* apps/api/internal/einvoice/testdata/cius-ro: CIUS-RO validation artefacts (ANAF, mfinante.gov.ro), including
  OASIS UBL 2.1 schemas (OASIS; notices in the files) and rules compiled with SchXslt.
* apps/api/internal/vatreturn/testdata/ech0217: eCH-0217 V2.0.0 and the eCH schemas it imports (eCH, ech.ch).
Each folder's README names the source and download date.

